  "body": "The request of the maintainer (relayed 2026-11-17, quoted in #2392): \"a good way of testing the various operations\".\n\n## What\n\n`crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs` has two tests. Each test is one loop through all cases. The first failure hides the other cases. The time of all cases adds up in one `#[test]`.\n\n- Change the loops so that a failure names its case and the other cases continue.\n- Give each case a time budget. AGENTS.md \"Testing\" moves a test of more than about 60 s in debug to the heavy lane.\n- A case that is more than the budget goes to the heavy lane, with the lane named in its ignore reason. Or it gets a smaller model.\n\nDone means: two broken cases give two named failures in one run. The `#[test]` count does not go down. No case in the default lane takes more than about 60 s in debug. The time of each case is in the test output.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
